  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n**Availability**: share of requests without a 5xx. **Latency**: share of requests faster than the threshold set in Terraform (`slo.latency_threshold`).\n\nThe **error budget** is how much can still fail inside the SLO window without missing the target. The **burn rate** compares the current error pace with the pace that would spend the budget exactly at the end of the window: 1x is sustainable, 14.4x over 1h pages (multi-window alerts from the Google SRE Workbook).\n"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
